## Sprint 18 Track D — Surface Leg 3 + Leg 4 drift in Phase C warn log

S17 added Leg 3 (`charges_missing_tax_line`) to `commission_splits_drift_check` RPC. S18 Track C is adding Leg 4 (`refunds_missing_tax_reversal`). The Phase C warn log in this file currently only surfaces Leg 1 (`pis_missing_split`) and Leg 2 (`disputes_missing_reversal`). Need to extend to Legs 3 + 4.

## What to change

Find the Phase C drift warn log block (likely looks like):

```ts
if (!('error' in commissionResult)) {
  const driftFound =
    commissionResult.pis_missing_split.length > 0 ||
    commissionResult.disputes_missing_reversal.length > 0;
  if (driftFound) {
    logger.warn({
      pis_missing_split: commissionResult.pis_missing_split.length,
      disputes_missing_reversal: commissionResult.disputes_missing_reversal.length,
      sample_pi_ids: commissionResult.pis_missing_split.slice(0, 5).map(p => p.payment_intent_id),
      sample_dispute_ids: commissionResult.disputes_missing_reversal.slice(0, 5).map(d => d.dispute_id),
    }, 'phase C: commission_splits drift detected');
  }
}
```

Replace with:

```ts
if (!('error' in commissionResult)) {
  // Defensive: Leg 3 (S17) + Leg 4 (S18) may not be present in older drift_check responses.
  const charges_missing_tax_line = commissionResult.charges_missing_tax_line ?? [];
  const refunds_missing_tax_reversal = commissionResult.refunds_missing_tax_reversal ?? [];

  const driftFound =
    commissionResult.pis_missing_split.length > 0 ||
    commissionResult.disputes_missing_reversal.length > 0 ||
    charges_missing_tax_line.length > 0 ||
    refunds_missing_tax_reversal.length > 0;

  if (driftFound) {
    logger.warn({
      pis_missing_split: commissionResult.pis_missing_split.length,
      disputes_missing_reversal: commissionResult.disputes_missing_reversal.length,
      charges_missing_tax_line: charges_missing_tax_line.length,
