      sample_dispute_ids: commissionResult.disputes_missing_reversal.slice(0, 5).map(d => d.dispute_id),
      sample_tax_line_pi_ids: charges_missing_tax_line.slice(0, 5).map(c => c.payment_intent_id),
      sample_tax_reversal_pi_ids: refunds_missing_tax_reversal.slice(0, 5).map(r => r.payment_intent_id),
    }, 'phase C: commission_splits drift detected (4 legs)');
  }
}
```

